{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_022ser_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b9543c7ea01819ecd2b0b3429a2ea59a28726afbefc8019a7cb0742afbc5f68a", "ja": "（今は39プロジェクトのオーディションの\n真っ最中だ。さて、次はどんな子だろう……）", "zh": "（目前正在进行39PROJECT的甄选，\n下一位又会是怎么样的人呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_022ser_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_001_1001_p", "source_sha256": "9e453fa5257166bfa94d3e9ffd59ec79fcd88d14b828639e92c5210a01b981b8", "ja": "それでは、次の方。\n自己紹介からお願いします。", "zh": "那么，下一位。\n请你自我介绍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_022ser_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_001_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "884ca4a5418d80b3dd1ad28fa60c4a5f93a11e50592c3e553d52e47e6849331d", "ja": "は、はい、初めまして！\n箱崎星梨花といいますっ。13歳です！", "zh": "好，好的，初次见面！\n我叫箱崎星梨花，13岁！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_022ser_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_001_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "0bc1c2d4441f16980e12d38914160926ef4a781152107da6875a5692de92d610", "ja": "えっと、プロデューサーさん……ですよね？\n今日はよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "呃，你是制作人先生……对吗？\n今天还请多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_022ser_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_001_1004_p", "source_sha256": "7c52564e25551ac58d6329dc63836a4a725907497fd4a9373add1738f7798533", "ja": "はい、よろしくお願いします。スタッフの人から聞いた\nけど、オーディションの1時間前から来てたんだって？", "zh": "好的，请你多多指教。我听工作人员说，\n你好像在甄选前一小时就到了是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_022ser_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_001_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "13e6328a742887faee1d1b64a65881d559526d8766a2d4d640c2aced95616a7e", "ja": "はい！　みなさんに迷惑がかかるから、遅刻だけは\n絶対にしちゃダメよって、ママに言われたので。", "zh": "是的！因为妈妈说迟到会给大家添麻烦，\n要我千万不能迟到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_022ser_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_001_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d7e3e2c9d47ed59afc4b5987346aaa351e4d7e35b395cb137476719da5a1a0e3", "ja": "（真面目な子だな。お辞儀や言葉遣いも丁寧だし、\n大事に育てられてきた、いい子なんだろうな）", "zh": "（个性很认真呢。人很有礼貌，说话也很稳重，\n应该是在细心呵护之下长大的好孩子吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_022ser_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_001_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a83ee2aaa9ef47b47117fc612545461af48b117311736f7693a5e46fc58c0605", "ja": "それじゃあ、アイドルになろうと思ったきっかけを\n教えてもらえるかな？", "zh": "那么，你能告诉我为什么想当偶像吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_022ser_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_001_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "b02ba2e8d3d351b337380e0d8350d6a974e12af79856cb5a81ac71e975046c96", "ja": "はい！　パパのお友達に、アイドルのことを\n教えてもらったのがきっかけです！", "zh": "好的！契机是爸爸的朋友\n跟我说了关于偶像的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_022ser_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_001_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "8e56d0d770b6d0f5546e9cff4194dd9ada279fbeef90b30201742f739e135f31", "ja": "アイドルになったら色々なところに行けて、\n世の中のこと、たくさん教えてもらえるって！", "zh": "他说如果当了偶像，就能去很多地方，\n也能学到很多人情世故！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_022ser_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_001_1010_p", "source_sha256": "946ccf2fe3defa30bc6205fa11283596188c413ca400d014c1bc95acaac68469", "ja": "なるほど。ということは、ご両親に応援されて\nオーディションを受けにきたのかな？", "zh": "原来如此。\n所以你是在父母的支持下来参加甄选的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_022ser_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_001_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "b3291b340201ad9834ffbd895888d137736aa5b61337c7a0c1f24a147646207e", "ja": "いえ……パパにはずっと反対されてました。\n芸能界なんて絶対にダメだ！って……。", "zh": "不是……爸爸一直反对我当偶像，\n他说「绝对不能进演艺圈！」……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_022ser_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_001_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "4b8655013386863d54d3af394f0ee7d6586578cac9596f6587b90d2815852146", "ja": "でも、わたし、諦められなかったんです。\nアイドルになって、広い世界を見てみたかったから！", "zh": "但我无法放弃。\n因为我想成为偶像，去看看辽阔的世界！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_022ser_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_001_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "0154b2229fc087ebe7e0b9540133b3177f42c0e963e15818ec72124995109f1f", "ja": "だから、何度も何度もパパにお願いしたんです。\nそうしたら、パパも認めてくれました！", "zh": "所以我一次次地拜托爸爸，\n然后爸爸也同意了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_022ser_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_001_1014_p", "source_sha256": "57706b6bb242b3a4ae1f7fa425c8e0dbd65541a207429a3c0a14b072ac99624f", "ja": "そっか。それだけ、アイドルになりたい\nっていう気持ちが強かったんだね。", "zh": "这样啊。\n可见你想成为偶像的意志有多么强烈呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_022ser_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_001_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "51a9c1a8cae3b90c4664af85f4f384943ddab21cc935a16366488c55778b5e29", "ja": "はい！　わたし、アイドルになって、\nもっとたくさんのことを知りたいんです！", "zh": "是的！我想成为偶像，\n学习更多更多的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_022ser_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_001_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "6829e7b5af12a333a21f1bcd25044bc09d0d106ce1f19513b39bac8b384b64e6", "ja": "まだまだ知らないことだらけですけど、アイドルの\nことも芸能界のことも、一生懸命お勉強します！", "zh": "虽然我还有很多事不懂，\n但关于偶像跟演艺圈的事，我都会拚命学习的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_022ser_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_001_1017_p", "source_sha256": "f99e0359c6fad4415f4ba6335168834656282e3b045c19cb85c7bc5e9dc09262", "ja": "（箱入り娘なのかと思ったけど、好奇心だけじゃなく\n粘り強さや行動力もあるな……よし！）", "zh": "（原以为她是备受保护的温室花朵，\n但她不只好奇心强，也很坚定、有行动力……很好！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_022ser_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_001_1018", "source_sha256": "82ba7c0d8c36a1f2eea44a72c4f98c86ac32928739faf770b0e6dad375a952d7", "ja": "合格だ！", "zh": "录取！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_022ser_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "290baf03bb78920f403f7d2074db78b7259b69b31263581dde919d14fd5b21a4", "ja": "今日から君は、39プロジェクトのアイドルだ。\n一緒に頑張ろう！", "zh": "从今天起，你就是39PROJECT的偶像，\n一起奋斗吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_022ser_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_001_2001_022ser", "source_sha256": "6ddde2aecc7bb207b9d379c28af33fec542bb0a3dbb5e0b9ac714c993297bea4", "ja": "本当ですか！？　やった～！　えへへ♪\nありがとうございます、プロデューサーさん！", "zh": "真的吗！？太棒了～！嘿嘿♪\n非常感谢你，制作人先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_022ser_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_001_2002_022ser", "source_sha256": "5e32ca2168dffb32c3deef24e9a186e43c814f1ece9389f5b987111075e0a2b9", "ja": "これからアイドルのこと、いっぱい教えてくださいね。\nわたし、頑張って覚えます！", "zh": "今后还请多多教我关于偶像的事。\n我会很努力学的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_022ser_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_001_2003_p", "source_sha256": "9d2870e2603ff974a8b4e0252ad1b6bc101db03d3e00acf4b76512343bc7ebae", "ja": "（この素直さは、アイドルとして武器になるはずだ。\nそれをしっかり磨いていってあげよう！）", "zh": "（她的这份坦率，应该会成为偶像的一种武器。\n我要好好锻炼她！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
